=False), **FileEditAction**\nPath: [/workspace/feedback.html]\nThought: \nCommand: create\nCreated File with Text:\n```\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Quick Feedback</title>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; }\n    h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }\n    form { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; max-width: 640px; }\n    textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 90px; padding: 0.5rem; font: inherit; }\n    button { width: fit-content; padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }\n    hr { margin: 1.25rem 0; }\n    ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }\n    .comment { padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; background: #f6f8fa; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; white-space: pre-wrap; }\n    .empty { color: #666; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Quick Feedback</h1>\n  <form id=\"feedbackForm\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"comment\">Your comment</label>\n    <textarea id=\"comment\" name=\"comment\" placeholder=\"Type your feedback here...\" required></textarea>\n    <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n  </form>\n\n  <hr />\n\n  <section>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1rem; margin:0 0 0.5rem;\">Comments</h2>\n    <p id=\"emptyState\" class=\"empty\">No comments yet. Be the first!</p>\n    <ul id=\"comments\"></ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <script>\n    const form = document.getElementById('feedbackForm');\n    const textarea = document.getElementById('comment');\n    const list = document.getElementById('comments');\n    const empty = document.getElementById('emptyState');\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const text = textarea.value.trim();\n      if (!text) return;\n\n      if (empty) empty.style.display = 'none';\n\n      const li = document.createElement('li');\n      li.className = 'comment';\n      li.textContent = text;\n      list.prepend(li); // newest first\n\n      textarea.value = '';\n      textarea.focus();\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n```\n, FileEditObservation(content='File created successfully at: /workspace/feedback.html', path='/workspace/feedback.html', prev_exist=False, old_content=None, new_content=None, observation='edit', impl_source='oh_aci', diff='--- /workspace/feedback.html\\n+++ /workspace/feedback.html\\n@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\\n+<!DOCTYPE html>\\n+<html lang=\"en\">\\n+<head>\\n+  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\\n+  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\\n+  <title>Quick Feedback</title>\\n+  <style>\\n+    body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; }\\n+    h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }\\n+    form { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; max-width: 640px; }\\n+    textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 90px; padding: 0.5rem; font: inherit; }\\n+    button { width: fit-content; padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }\\n+    hr { margin: 1.25rem 0; }\\n+    ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }\\n+    .comment { padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; background: #f6f8fa; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; white-space: pre-wrap; }\\n+    .empty { color: #666; }\\n+  </style>\\n+</head>\\n+<body>\\n+  <h1>Quick Feedback</h1>\\n+  <form id=\"feedbackForm\" autocomplete=\"off\">\\n+    <label for=\"comment\">Your comment</label>\\n+    <textarea id=\"comment\" name=\"comment\" placeholder=\"Type your feedback here...\" required></textarea>\\n+    <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\\n+  </form>\\n@@ -1,0 +27,33 @@\\n+  <hr />\\n+\\n+  <section>\\n+    <h2 style=\"font-size:1rem; margin:0 0 0.5rem;\">Comments</h2>\\n+    <p id=\"emptyState\" class=\"empty\">No comments yet. Be the first!</p>\\n+    <ul id=\"comments\"></ul>\\n+  </